Package: agent-go
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: single-binary terminal AI agent (OpenAI-compatible streaming)
 agent-go is a minimal terminal AI agent in ~1600 lines of pure Go,
 standard library only, zero third-party dependencies.
 It streams from any OpenAI-compatible chat API, executes tool calls
 (exec, image_read, video_read), accepts multimodal attachments and
 persists sessions to JSON files with raw-mode line editing.
 .
 This package contains the command-line tool.
